                  <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBox_Signals">
                   <property name="text">
                    <string>Signal delay on signalized links</string>
                   </property>
                   <property name="toolTip">
                    <string>SIGNAL_MODEL - caps a signalized link's discharge at saturation flow x lanes x g/C and adds the uniform control delay per signal, using the link's NSignals (signalized nodes along it, from netPrep). Applies to macro and meso links. Unchecked: no signal capacity cap or delay at all, and the fields below are not used. With Use GMNS in the run, a timed approach uses its plan's g/C and cycle.</string>
                   </property>
                  </widget>
                 </item>
