                     <item row="2" column="3">
                      <widget class="QComboBox" name="comboBox_MicroModel">
                       <property name="toolTip">
                        <string>MICRO_MODEL. Freeway corridor: one contiguous freeway / express-lane corridor with EL choice and tolls. Network: every link of the micro area with its intersections -- lanes, pockets, movements, signal timing and stop / yield control from the GMNS package (GMNS tab).</string>
